Package: paketscope
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pyside6.qtwidgets, python3-cryptography, apt, pkexec
Description: Desktop application inventory and APT package manager
 PaketScope gives users a searchable view of installed APT/dpkg and Flatpak
 applications. It can preview and confirm selected APT package installation,
 removal, and purge operations using the system's polkit authentication flow.
 Package changes are never made automatically in the background.
